<cfsilent>
<!---
    The goal of this file is to allow developers a location where they
    can add their own procedural functions. This file is loaded during
    the bootstrap process, before system/Common.cfm.

    This can be looked at as a `master helper` file that is loaded early
    on, and may also contain additional functions that you'd like to use
    throughout your entire application.

    Unlike CodeIgniter, it can't replace a function from system/Common.cfm:
    ColdFusion 5 won't declare the same function name twice in one request.
--->
</cfsilent>
